# Build outputs. The bind artifact is ~100MB and is regenerated by
# `gomobile bind`; the Xcode project is regenerated by `xcodegen`. build/ is
# the bind package the CLI generates from ui/ — generated Go, and the one
# thing here that would otherwise be committable.
/build/
/ios/Mirrormobile.xcframework/
/ios/GophicsMirror.xcodeproj/
/ios/build/
/android/app/libs/*.aar
/android/app/libs/*.jar
/android/app/build/
/android/.gradle/
